This directory contains all of the source and headers from the contrib/src/xrc
and contrib/include/wx/xrc from the wxWidgets distribution.  The current
version comes from:

  wxGTK-2.4.2

Note that the expat files have been moved to this directory to simplify the
make system.  They can be identified as *.c and *.h.  The XRC files are the
*.cpp files.  We only need the following files from expat:

    xmltok.c xmlrole.c xmlparse.c xmltok_impl.c xmltok_ns.c

The license of XRC is the same as the license for the wxWidgets library
that we link to elsewhere.
